WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,020
You understand, but

2
00:00:05,220 --> 00:00:06,420
Since you are back

3
00:00:06,820 --> 00:00:08,420
Don't think about those troublesome things

4
00:00:08,820 --> 00:00:09,820
This damn weather

5
00:00:09,820 --> 00:00:11,820
You can stay at home for two days with peace of mind

6
00:00:12,220 --> 00:00:13,420
No need to rush back

7
00:00:13,820 --> 00:00:15,220
Let him worry about himself

8
00:00:19,630 --> 00:00:20,830
It tastes like medicine

9
00:00:21,030 --> 00:00:22,630
Third aunt rests all year round

10
00:00:22,830 --> 00:00:24,030
I came rashly

11
00:00:24,430 --> 00:00:26,030
I'm afraid it will disturb her rest

12
00:00:26,230 --> 00:00:28,030
But the old lady has given orders

13
00:00:28,230 --> 00:00:46,940
How dare I shirk the girl to invite my aunt to sit down? Hurry up and sit down

14
00:00:46,940 --> 00:00:49,840
Isn't my uncle in the hospital today?
